Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:31.68,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Boy you’re playing with fire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:33.30,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}負ける気しないわ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:38.73,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Don’t stop 志込めた銃弾
