Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.99,0:22:30.70,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}頭ん中パンクしてる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.70,0:22:32.71,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}No, it cannot be true
