Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:40.63,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}Tick tock tick tock
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.63,0:22:41.72,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}前　前ならえ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:43.13,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}Yah　ついていくしかないじゃん
