Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.30,0:22:48.56,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}Don’t stop, pop, pop
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.56,0:22:50.77,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}We’re going up, up, up higher
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.77,0:22:53.02,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}暗闇の中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:54.52,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}無音で drive
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.52,0:22:57.52,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}孤独な傷跡が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.52,0:23:00.53,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}名前を呼ぶ声に今
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.53,0:23:03.03,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.1\blur2}満たされ癒えていく
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.03,0:23:04.07,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}始まったんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.07,0:23:06.28,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}駆け出す未来は今
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:08.16,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}狙い定めた
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.16,0:23:09.58,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}Because I’m a winner
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:12.95,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.1\blur2}迷うたびに笑い飛ばしていけ
